      en: ["Inaugurated in November 2011 near Zinder.", "It is Niger's first and only petroleum refinery.", "A joint venture between CNPC (China) and the Nigerien state.", "Daily processing capacity is around 20,000 barrels.", "Sources crude oil from the Agadem block via a pipeline.", "Produces gasoline, diesel, and LPG for the domestic market.", "Aims to reduce Niger's dependence on imported refined fuels."]
